[p]The [b]Ukrainian Games Festival 2025[/b] has officially started, and [b]Hell Of War[/b] is taking part! 🇺🇦
This is our first time participating in such a major Steam event, making it a very special moment for us.[/p][p]For the festival, we’ve prepared a [b]major update[/b] to the game’s Steam page:
• 🎬 A brand new, more dynamic trailer with a focus on key mechanics;
• 📸 New in-game screenshots;
• 📝 An updated description that better reflects the essence of the game.[/p][hr][/hr][h3]🔧 What’s currently in development?[/h3][p]Alongside the festival, we are working on:
• 🔧 Improving AI and tactical gameplay;
• 🗺️ Creating new maps;
• 🔫 Adding new weapons;
• ⚙️ Optimizing code and graphics for better performance on lower-end PCs;
• 🧪 Preparing for [b]Closed Testing[/b], planned for this autumn.[/p][p]📢 [b]Important:[/b] Recruitment for the test will be announced [b]exclusively in our Discord[/b] — join us so you don’t miss it![/p][p]🔗 [url="https://discord.gg/u9fcaUH8Ab" style="button"]Discord[/url][/p][p][/p]
